# The generator writes LF deliberately. Without this, Git checks files out as
# CRLF on Windows and every rebuild shows as a diff when nothing changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Every raster format media\ accepts, marked binary explicitly. `text=auto`
# above would otherwise be left to guess, and a guess that goes the wrong way
# rewrites bytes inside an image on checkout. .svg is genuinely text and is
# deliberately not listed.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
